WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.934 --> 00:00:14.630
Emmy and Harry were going outside to play.

2
00:00:14.631 --> 00:00:18.850
"Wait a minute, you two!" said Mom.

3
00:00:18.851 --> 00:00:21.851
"Today is Chores Day."

4
00:00:21.852 --> 00:00:26.944
Emmy and Harry groaned.

5
00:00:26.945 --> 00:00:30.421
"Please dust all the furniture," said Mom.

6
00:00:30.422 --> 00:00:33.491
"I'll sweep all the floors."

7
00:00:33.492 --> 00:00:40.713
Harry got the feather dusters.

8
00:00:40.714 --> 00:00:47.691
Emmy and Harry started dusting tables and chairs.

9
00:00:47.692 --> 00:00:51.291
"This will take forever," groaned Emmy.

10
00:00:51.292 --> 00:00:55.507
Soon Oliver and Tom ran into the room.

11
00:00:55.508 --> 00:01:05.166
"We're space rangers!" shouted Oliver.

12
00:01:05.167 --> 00:01:08.496
"Watch out, Tom!" Oliver yelled.

13
00:01:08.497 --> 00:01:15.522
"Here come some evil aliens!"

14
00:01:15.523 --> 00:01:18.672
Tom started to run away.

15
00:01:18.673 --> 00:01:21.549
Then he spotted Emmy's feather duster.

16
00:01:21.550 --> 00:01:24.638
"What's that?" asked Tom.

17
00:01:24.639 --> 00:01:28.558
Emmy had an idea.

18
00:01:28.559 --> 00:01:32.150
"It's a special space wand," she said.

19
00:01:32.151 --> 00:01:36.343
"It stops aliens."

20
00:01:36.344 --> 00:01:40.230
"How does it work?" asked Tom.

21
00:01:40.231 --> 00:01:42.907
Emmy showed him.

22
00:01:42.908 --> 00:01:46.555
"You dust all the furniture.

23
00:01:46.556 --> 00:01:51.866
That makes the aliens go away."

24
00:01:51.867 --> 00:01:55.081
"Can I have your space wand?" asked Tom.

25
00:01:55.082 --> 00:01:57.624
"Um . . . ," said Emmy.

26
00:01:57.625 --> 00:02:03.181
She pretended to think for a minute.

27
00:02:03.182 --> 00:02:07.988
"Okay."

28
00:02:07.989 --> 00:02:12.542
Oliver looked at Harry.

29
00:02:12.543 --> 00:02:21.750
"Can I have your space wand, please?"

30
00:02:21.751 --> 00:02:23.598
"I guess so. . ."

31
00:02:23.599 --> 00:02:27.227
Harry handed it over.

32
00:02:27.228 --> 00:02:31.119
Oliver dusted the tables with his space wand.

33
00:02:31.120 --> 00:02:37.652
Tom dusted the chairs.

34
00:02:37.653 --> 00:02:47.095
"Good-bye, evil aliens!" cried the boys.

35
00:02:47.096 --> 00:02:51.097
But Emmy and Harry couldn't hear them.

36
00:02:51.098 --> 00:03:11.348
Emmy and Harry were outside, playing.
